---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base
  title="Curriculum vitae"
  description="Verified career materials for Dr. Ian Helfrich are being updated from primary records."
>
  <header class="page-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Curriculum vitae · Accuracy review in progress</span>
    <h1>Current materials are being verified.</h1>
    <p class="kicker">
      I retired the previous public PDFs because they no longer represented my
      current research, teaching, and quantitative practice accurately. A new
      executive résumé and a complete evidence-linked CV are being rebuilt from
      primary records.
    </p>
    <div class="button-row">
      <a class="button" href="mailto:ianthelfrich@gmail.com?subject=Current%20CV%20request">Request the current CV</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/research">Current research</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/teaching">Teaching record</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/job-market">Job-market profile</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section compact" aria-labelledby="current-work">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <span class="section-label">Current work</span>
        <h2 id="current-work">Research, teaching, and systems that can be inspected.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        The public research and teaching records remain available while the
        replacement documents complete factual and visual review.
      </p>
    </div>
    <ul class="credential-list">
      <li><a href="/research/helfrich-2026-nmtc-rural-gap">New Markets Tax Credit research and public evidence record</a></li>
      <li><a href="/work">Selected analytical work and evidence systems</a></li>
      <li><a href="/teaching">University, professional, and independent quantitative instruction</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Base>
